dw 'Leonhard set out on a journey of rebirth, but decided instead to serve the goddess as a knight, and inherited this weapon.',A
dw '',A
dw 'Skill: Crescent Blade',A
dw 'Assume a broad stance and fire off crescent moon blades.',0
[[[[MsgRepository]+08]+00]+0640]+A562:
